</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;align-items:stretch\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding:0 7px\">Projects</span><span style=\"padding:2px 7px 2px 16px;border-radius:4px\">All projects</span><span style=\"padding:2px 7px 2px 16px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand)\">Assigned to me</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);padding:0 7px\">System</span><span style=\"padding:2px 7px 2px 16px;border-radius:4px\">Members</span><span style=\"padding:2px 7px 2px 16px;border-radius:4px\">Settings</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Design system</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:stretch;gap:8px;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:84%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;border-left:2px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">Background</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--brand);\"><i style=\"position:absolute;left:-2px;top:5px;bottom:5px;width:2px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></i>Approach</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">Risks</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">Conclusion</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Long structured knowledge base</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap;align-items:center\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;height:28px;bord